---
/**
 * How membership works, with what it costs beside it. Figures are mirrored
 * from src/pages/membership.astro and must stay in sync with it: $200/month
 * individual, family from $175 down to $100 per person, six-month minimum,
 * 30 days' written notice.
 */
---

<section class="how" aria-label="How membership works">
  <div class="rd-wrap how-grid">
    <div class="how-text">
      <h2 class="rd-h2">How membership works</h2>
      <p>
        You pay a flat monthly fee directly to the practice. We don't bill insurance,
        which is what makes the small panel and the long visit financially possible in
        the first place.
      </p>
      <p>
        Membership covers your primary care. Most members pair it with a high-deductible
        plan for hospitalization, surgery, and specialist care. Nothing about your visit
        is shaped by what a billing code will reimburse.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="costs">
      <p class="rd-eyebrow costs-label">What membership costs</p>
      <div class="costs-grid">
        <div class="cost cost--left">
          <div class="cost-name">Individual</div>
          <div class="cost-figure rd-serif">$200<span class="cost-unit">/month</span></div>
          <p class="cost-body">
            One flat monthly fee covering unlimited visits with no copay, same-day and
            next-day appointments, direct phone, text, and email access to your
            physician, preventive and chronic care, minor in-office procedures,
            telehealth, specialist coordination, and Lifestyle Medicine. Labs and
            medications are passed through at wholesale.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="cost cost--right">
          <div class="cost-name">Family</div>
          <div class="cost-figure rd-serif"><span class="cost-unit cost-unit--lead">from</span>$175<span class="cost-unit cost-unit--tail">per person/month</span></div>
          <p class="cost-body">
            The per-person rate decreases as the family grows, down to $100 per person
            at five or more members. Children are welcome at every age.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="costs-terms">
        <strong>Terms, stated plainly:</strong> membership carries a six-month minimum
        commitment from your enrollment date. After that it's month to month, and
        cancelling takes 30 days' written notice. There is no enrollment fee, no copay,
        and nothing else billed for primary care. Many members can pay with HSA funds
        following the Primary Care Enhancement Act, effective January 1, 2026 &mdash;
        confirm with your plan administrator.
      </p>
      <div class="costs-ctas">
        <a href="/membership/" class="btn-ghost">See all membership tiers &rarr;</a>
        <a href="/contact/" class="btn-forest">Schedule a free meet &amp; greet</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .how {
    background: var(--linen-50);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hairline);
    padding: 96px 0;
  }
  .how-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 0.8fr 1.2fr;
    gap: 72px;
    align-items: start;
  }
  .how-text { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; }
  .how-text p { font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-700); margin: 0; }

  .costs { display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .costs-label { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .costs-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; }
  .cost { padding: 28px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--forest); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 10px; }
  .cost--left { padding-right: 32px; border-right: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong); }
  .cost--right { padding-left: 32px; }
  .cost-name { font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--sage-600); }
  .cost-figure { font-size: 52px; line-height: 1.05; color: var(--forest); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
  .cost-unit { display: inline-block; font-size: 18px; color: var(--text-600); letter-spacing: 0; }
  .cost-unit--lead { margin-right: 0.3em; }
  .cost-unit--tail { margin-left: 0.3em; }
  .cost-body { margin: 6px 0 0; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.7; color: var(--text-700); }
  .costs-terms {
    margin: 0;
    padding: 22px 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hairline-strong);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--text-600);
  }
  .costs-terms strong { color: var(--forest); }
  .costs-ctas { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 14px; margin-top: 28px; align-items: center; }

  @media (max-width: 860px) {
    .how { padding: 64px 0; }
    .how-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; }
    .costs-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .cost--left { padding-right: 0; border-right: 0; }
    .cost--right { padding-left: 0; }
    .cost-figure { font-size: 40px; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 560px) {
    .costs-ctas a { width: 100%; }
  }
</style>
